## Layer 2️⃣：算法基础模式 (Algorithm Patterns)

**目标：掌握核心10个解题模板**

### Pattern 组织

| Pattern | 代表题 | 状态 | 复杂度 |
|---------|--------|------|--------|
| **DFS** | Number of Islands | node | O(V+E) |
| **BFS** | Word Ladder | node + extra | O(V+E) |
| **Backtracking** | Permutation/Subset | path + index | O(n!) |
| **Binary Search** | Koko Eating | answer | O(log answer) |
| **Heap** | Top K Frequent | (priority, value) | O(n log k) |
| **Union Find** | Redundant Connection | parent[] | O(α(n)) |
| **Topological Sort** | Course Schedule | indegree[] | O(V+E) |
| **Dijkstra** | Network Delay | (distance, node) | O((V+E) log V) |
| **Sliding Window** | Longest Substring | left, right | O(n) |
| **Prefix Sum** | Subarray Sum K | currentSum | O(n) space |

**关键体悟：**
* 每个Pattern都有标准的State定义
* State = 问题的关键信息
* 理解State = 理解Pattern

**进度：✅ 已完成80%**

